cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or model, please cite it as below."
title: "All-Japan-Grid: an OSM-derived, externally validated model of Japan's transmission network"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Shigenobu"
    given-names: "Ryuto"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lutelute/All-Japan-Grid"
license:
  - MIT
  - ODbL-1.0
version: 1.8.0
date-released: 2026-08-27
keywords:
  - power system
  - transmission network
  - OpenStreetMap
  - CIM CGMES
  - Japan
abstract: >-
  Geographic and electrical model of Japan's 10 regional transmission
  networks built from OpenStreetMap, with provenance-tracked curation in
  a unified database, CIM/CGMES Level-1/2 exports, AC/DC power-flow
  cases for all regions, and external validation against utility
  disclosures (per-line flow measurements, official line lists).
